# A pull request touching any of these needs the repository owner's review before it can merge.
#
# Enforce this by turning on "Require review from Code Owners" in
# Settings -> Branches -> branch protection rule for the default branch.

# Claude Code hooks and agent definitions run locally when the repo is opened.
/.claude/                 @Gilhzn
/scripts/                 @Gilhzn

